# This repo deliberately ships CLAUDE.md files (the example vault's conventions
# are part of the product). Un-ignore them in case your global gitignore excludes CLAUDE.md.
!CLAUDE.md

# The repo's own root CLAUDE.md is working instructions, not product. Keep it local,
# per the global ignore. (Last matching pattern wins, so this re-ignores just the root.)
/CLAUDE.md

# The base vault bundles the skills in .claude/skills/ so one copy yields a working
# vault. Un-ignore that path in case your global gitignore excludes .claude/.
!base/.claude/
!base/.claude/**

# The example vault ships .claude/settings.json as product content too.
!examples/belfoot-vault/.claude/
!examples/belfoot-vault/.claude/**

# Its skills, however, are copied in by the user to try the demo (see examples/README.md)
# and stay untracked, so base/.claude/skills/ remains their single source.
examples/belfoot-vault/.claude/skills/
